        "why": "The snapshot had one of them."
      },
      {
        "text": "Only after-snapshot",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "It was written after the save."
      },
      {
        "text": "Only before-snapshot",
        "correct": true,
        "why": "Right."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
